    "created_at": "2026-04-02T12:19:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-02T13:00:55Z",
    "body": "When agent tries to apply the changes, continue calls model without any prompt and pass the output of the model to the file.\nSome trace:\n\n\n```\ndata: {\"id\":\"chatcmpl-808\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1775131739,\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"system_fingerprint\":\"fp_ollama\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call_qz9aba30\",\"index\":0,\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"edit_existing_file\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"filepath\\\":\\\"example_file.js\\\",\\\"changes\\\":\\\"    last.after(feedback);\\\\n    completed.push(feedback);\\\\n    console.log(\\\\\\\"Success\\\\\\\");\\\\n    return true;\\\"}\"}}]},\"finish_reason\":null}]}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"chatcmpl-808\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1775131739,\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"system_fingerprint\":\"fp_ollama\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\"},\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}]}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"chatcmpl-808\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1775131739,\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"system_fingerprint\":\"fp_ollama\",\"choices\":[],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":4639,\"completion_tokens\":79,\"total_tokens\":4718}}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n{\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"\"}],\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"max_tokens\":260000,\"stream\":true}\n```\n\n\nthis last\n`{\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"\"}],\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"max_tokens\":260000,\"stream\":true}` creates the problem.\n\n\nWhen using different model for Apply role, it sends proper prompt to it. \n\n```\ndata: {\"id\":\"chatcmpl-167\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1775134298,\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"system_fingerprint\":\"fp_ollama\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call_ffzbnjk5\",\"index\":0,\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"edit_existing_file\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"changes\\\":\\\"    last.after(feedback);\\\\n    console.log(\\\\\\\"Success\\\\\\\");\\\\n    return true;\\\",\\\"filepath\\\":\\\"example_file.js\\\"}\"}}]},\"finish_reason\":null}]}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"chatcmpl-167\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1775134298,\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"system_fingerprint\":\"fp_ollama\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"delta\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\"},\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}]}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"chatcmpl-167\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"created\":1775134298,\"model\":\"qwen3.5:35b-a3b\",\"system_fingerprint\":\"fp_ollama\",\"choices\":[],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":3348,\"completion_tokens\":97,\"total_tokens\":3445}}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n{\"model\":\"devstral-small-2:24b\",\"max_tokens\":32000,\"stream\":true,\n\"prompt\":\"<|im_start|>user\\nORIGINAL CODE:\\n```\\nlast = window.last;\\nconst inject = function (text) {\\n  try{\\n    const feedback = window.getFeedbackFromText(text);\\n    last.after(feedback);\\n    completed.push(feedback);\\n    return true;\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    console.error(e.message);\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n};\\n```\\n\\nSUGGESTED EDIT:\\n```\\n    last.after(feedback);\\n    console.log(\\\"Success\\\");\\n    return true;\\n```\\n\\nApply the SUGGESTED EDIT to the ORIGINAL CODE. \nOutput the complete modified file.\\n- Output ONLY code. Do NOT explain, summarize, or describe changes.\\n- Leave existing comments in place unless changes require modifying them.\\n- Preserve all unchanged code exactly as-is.<|im_end|>\\n<|im_start|>assistant\\n```\\n\"}\n```",
